***
A generalized continued fraction is a *simple continued fraction* if all partial numerators are
equal to one.
$$
  h + \dfrac{1}
            {b_0 + \dfrac{1}
                         {b_1 + \dfrac{1}
                                      {b_2 + \dfrac{1}
                                                   {b_3 + \dots}}}}
$$

